# D-3, decided once: RAW run output is regenerated by `pnpm bench` and stays out of git.
# What IS committed is the contract and the conclusion: bench/*.mjs (the harness),
# bench/expectations.json (the pre-registered tolerances), and the generated rows in
# docs/measurements.md. So no published number depends on a file a reviewer cannot open.
bench-out/

# Generated by `next build`; Next.js itself recommends not committing it.
next-env.d.ts
